{"3073940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "God Save Birmingham", "steam_appid": 3073940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God Save Birmingham is a physics-driven zombie survival simulator set in medieval Birmingham, England. As the town’s only survivor, you must scramble to fulfill your everyday needs, while avoiding the grasping hands and rotten teeth of your former friends and neighbors. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HISTORICAL TOWN WITH A HELLISH TWIST</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/dbbab3288e289b84c2489e24d2f54d96.poster.avif?t=1788281378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/dbbab3288e289b84c2489e24d2f54d96.webm?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/dbbab3288e289b84c2489e24d2f54d96.mp4?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a painstakingly rendered and reimagined medieval market town, now teeming with undead. But don’t let that stop you from seeing the sights! Drop by the historic Bull Ring, grab a bite to eat at the markets, or take a moment to rest at Saint Martin’s Church. Just remember to bar the doors first. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHYSICS THAT MATTER</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/5baccf4d9c5e04099032738e658e405f.poster.avif?t=1788281378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/5baccf4d9c5e04099032738e658e405f.webm?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/5baccf4d9c5e04099032738e658e405f.mp4?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every object in the game can be moved or manipulated to aid your chances of survival. Barricade a door with a dining table, grab a barrel and go bowling for zombies, or set a rushlight on the ground to light the room while you sleep. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the laws of nature also apply to you. Trip over a ledge, and you may lose your weapon. Fall from too high, and you might break your leg. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARDCORE SURVIVAL GAMEPLAY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/1504ff9e5e8a9141307a14f3642c59a5.poster.avif?t=1788281378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/1504ff9e5e8a9141307a14f3642c59a5.webm?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/1504ff9e5e8a9141307a14f3642c59a5.mp4?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the town in chaos, simply staying alive is a struggle. You’ll have to scavenge food, secure clean drinking water, keep warm, seek shelter at night, and try not to fall ill, all while dealing with a constant undead siege. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But man does not live by bread alone. You’ll also have to manage your mental state to avoid lapsing into despair or madness. You can also level up various survival-related skills by continuously practicing them, including mastery over certain weapon types. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOME IS WHERE THE HEART IS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/f4534c74f86d3261580931920df265b6.poster.avif?t=1788281378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/f4534c74f86d3261580931920df265b6.webm?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/f4534c74f86d3261580931920df265b6.mp4?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no one left to stop you, the real estate market has become… flexible. Seek out your choice of shelter, secure doors and windows, then cozy the place up to make it your own. With the right tools and scavenged resources, you can craft weapons, fixtures, and furniture to make any building your home — including door latches, barricades, bonfires, and a whole lot more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE MORE THE MERRIER</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of being the lone survivor? Hop into online co-op with friends to take on the zombie threat together. After a long day of scavenging and crafting, gather around a pot of hot porridge to share fireside tales. Slated for Early Access, multiplayer will allow a group of players to join a single session and team up for everyone’s survival in the sandbox environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God Save Birmingham is a physics-driven zombie survival simulator set in medieval Birmingham, England. As the town’s only survivor, you must scramble to fulfill your everyday needs, while avoiding the grasping hands and rotten teeth of your former friends and neighbors. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HISTORICAL TOWN WITH A HELLISH TWIST</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/dbbab3288e289b84c2489e24d2f54d96.poster.avif?t=1788281378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/dbbab3288e289b84c2489e24d2f54d96.webm?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/dbbab3288e289b84c2489e24d2f54d96.mp4?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a painstakingly rendered and reimagined medieval market town, now teeming with undead. But don’t let that stop you from seeing the sights! Drop by the historic Bull Ring, grab a bite to eat at the markets, or take a moment to rest at Saint Martin’s Church. Just remember to bar the doors first. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PHYSICS THAT MATTER</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/5baccf4d9c5e04099032738e658e405f.poster.avif?t=1788281378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/5baccf4d9c5e04099032738e658e405f.webm?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/5baccf4d9c5e04099032738e658e405f.mp4?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost every object in the game can be moved or manipulated to aid your chances of survival. Barricade a door with a dining table, grab a barrel and go bowling for zombies, or set a rushlight on the ground to light the room while you sleep. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the laws of nature also apply to you. Trip over a ledge, and you may lose your weapon. Fall from too high, and you might break your leg. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HARDCORE SURVIVAL GAMEPLAY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/1504ff9e5e8a9141307a14f3642c59a5.poster.avif?t=1788281378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/1504ff9e5e8a9141307a14f3642c59a5.webm?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/1504ff9e5e8a9141307a14f3642c59a5.mp4?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the town in chaos, simply staying alive is a struggle. You’ll have to scavenge food, secure clean drinking water, keep warm, seek shelter at night, and try not to fall ill, all while dealing with a constant undead siege. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But man does not live by bread alone. You’ll also have to manage your mental state to avoid lapsing into despair or madness. You can also level up various survival-related skills by continuously practicing them, including mastery over certain weapon types. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOME IS WHERE THE HEART IS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/f4534c74f86d3261580931920df265b6.poster.avif?t=1788281378\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/f4534c74f86d3261580931920df265b6.webm?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/extras/f4534c74f86d3261580931920df265b6.mp4?t=1788281378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no one left to stop you, the real estate market has become… flexible. Seek out your choice of shelter, secure doors and windows, then cozy the place up to make it your own. With the right tools and scavenged resources, you can craft weapons, fixtures, and furniture to make any building your home — including door latches, barricades, bonfires, and a whole lot more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE MORE THE MERRIER</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of being the lone survivor? Hop into online co-op with friends to take on the zombie threat together. After a long day of scavenging and crafting, gather around a pot of hot porridge to share fireside tales. Slated for Early Access, multiplayer will allow a group of players to join a single session and team up for everyone’s survival in the sandbox environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Judgment Day has come to medieval Birmingham, and a plague of flesh-hungry ghouls has claimed every living soul… except one. Fight to survive in a highly tactile, physics-based survival sim where every object can be manipulated. Make ends meet, or meet your end.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/6eb9797b4340483464a0442c711bbd2269fe1125/header.jpg?t=1788281378", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/731ce4c0e87f65eff5a12f76bf8c7fbc0a82d745/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788281378", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3073940/731ce4c0e87f65eff5a12f76bf8c7fbc0a82d745/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788281378", "website": "https://www.oceandrive.studio", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 / Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-7700K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060 6GB / AMD Radeon RX580 8GB / Intel Arc A750 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard/Onboard chipset<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 / Windows 11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-11700 / AMD Ryzen 7 5800X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3070 Ti 8GB / Nvidia GeForce RTX 4070 12GB / AMD Radeon RX 6800 XT 12GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard/Onboard chipset<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "<i>(c) 2024 Ocean Drive Studio, Inc. All Rights Reserved.</i>", "developers": ["Ocean Drive Studio, Inc."], "publishers": ["Ocean Drive Studio, Inc.", "Kakao Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms"